# Single source of truth for every port used by the local/E2E dev stack.
# Readers (must not hardcode a port instead of sourcing this file):
#   - scripts/start-local.sh, stop-local.sh, start-e2e.sh, stop-e2e.sh, validate-environment.sh
#   - tests/helpers/ports.ts (parsed by Playwright config and specs)
#   - swa-cli.config.json duplicates these values (static JSON can't source env);
#     scripts/validate-environment.sh asserts the two agree and fails loudly on drift.
# Plain KEY=VALUE lines only (no export, no quoting) so this also parses as a
# GitHub Actions env file and as line-oriented text in tests/helpers/ports.ts.
SWA_PORT=4280
WEB_PORT=5158
API_PORT=7071
AZURITE_BLOB_PORT=10000
AZURITE_QUEUE_PORT=10001
AZURITE_TABLE_PORT=10002
